dwarfs-utils (0.1.0) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Desktop suite: Viewer, Archiver, Caja/Nemo plugins, dwarfs-fm
    helper.
  * Replace placeholder cat CLI with dwarfs-fm and GUI apps.
  * Add dwarfs-fm mount/unmount with sibling directory rule.
  * Add Caja and Nemo DwarFS context-menu plugins.
  * Add dwarfs-viewer (metadata, content, integrity tabs).
  * Add dwarfs-archiver (create/unarchive/convert, open viewer option).
  * Split Debian packages: dwarfs-fm, viewer, archiver, caja-dwarfs,
    nemo-dwarfs.

